{
  "about": "G4 副屏主流程：用 testkit lite（素材库里自带一张合成图片「参考图」），保存主页书名，从右栏素材库打开这张图片，在查看器里画区域写批注并读回挂在这个文件上的批注。格式 5 起素材库只放文件（kernel-v5 §6），不再要另造库；最近访问只记条目，所以从素材库打开。框选后的撰写框现在拿不到键盘，打字、保存、读回三步暂挂 pending（见步骤里的说明）。",
  "steps": [
    {
      "seed": "lite"
    },
    {
      "call": "book.list",
      "save": "books"
    },
    {
      "call": "asset.list",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}"
      },
      "save": "assets",
      "expect": {
        "/0/kind": "image",
        "/1": null
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "comment.list",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}"
      },
      "save": "seed_comments"
    },
    {
      "launch": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "env": {
          "DRIFTING_APPEARANCE": "light",
          "DRIFTING_WINDOW_DISPLAY": "secondary"
        },
        "settings": {
          "account": {
            "language.ui_locale": "en"
          },
          "device": {
            "modules": {
              "first_run.done": true,
              "guides.seen": [
                "workspace-tour"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "save": "app"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "ready",
        "state": {
          "/book/version": 5,
          "/book/loaded": true
        },
        "timeout_ms": 30000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "app.info",
      "save": "environment"
    },
    {
      "app": "action.dispatch",
      "params": {
        "name": "workspace::ShowProjectHome"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "role": "Button",
        "label": "Settings"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "input.key",
      "params": {
        "keys": "secondary-a"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "input.type",
      "params": {
        "text": "G4 synthetic book"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "role": "Button",
        "label": "Save"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "ready",
        "state": {
          "/dialog": false
        },
        "timeout_ms": 30000
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "book.get",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}"
      },
      "expect": {
        "/name": "G4 synthetic book"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "window.focus"
    },
    {
      "app": "action.dispatch",
      "params": {
        "name": "workspace::ToggleRightSidebar"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/right/open": true
        },
        "timeout_ms": 15000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "role": "RadioButton",
        "label": "Library"
      },
      "note": "The library is the right column's 「素材库」 Tab; it holds the project's images and PDFs (kernel-v5 §6, T5)."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "role": "Group",
        "label": "${assets.0.name}"
      },
      "note": "A file opens in its viewer on the desk (T5)."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/page": "material:${assets.0.id}"
        },
        "timeout_ms": 15000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "action.dispatch",
      "params": {
        "name": "workspace::ToggleRightSidebar"
      },
      "note": "Close the library again: the viewer takes the paper's width and the picture sits where the drag below lands."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 1000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "role": "Button",
        "label": "Comment on a region"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "input.drag",
      "params": {
        "from": [
          570,
          420
        ],
        "to": [
          660,
          500
        ],
        "steps": 12
      },
      "note": "Inside the picture (about 410–729 × 335–534 with both columns closed)."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 400
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "role": "Button",
        "label": "Cancel"
      },
      "note": "Drawing a region opens the composer beside it (T6)."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "role": "Button",
        "label": "Save"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "input.type",
      "params": {
        "text": "${seed_comments.0.body}"
      },
      "pending": "待协调：The region composer opens under the drawn region, but neither it nor a click into its text box takes the keyboard (found 2026-11-16 by sc-scenarios-v5: the bridge's typing reports no focused text field; the text box has no accessible node). Product issue in the viewer's region composer (dr-view-material page.rs compose / dr-view-review composer); drop this pending once typing reaches it."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "role": "Button",
        "label": "Save"
      },
      "pending": "待协调：The region composer opens under the drawn region, but neither it nor a click into its text box takes the keyboard (found 2026-11-16 by sc-scenarios-v5: the bridge's typing reports no focused text field; the text box has no accessible node). Product issue in the viewer's region composer (dr-view-material page.rs compose / dr-view-review composer); drop this pending once typing reaches it."
    },
    {
      "call": "comment.list",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "target": {
          "kind": "asset",
          "id": "${assets.0.id}"
        }
      },
      "save": "comments",
      "expect": {
        "/0/body": "${seed_comments.0.body}",
        "/0/target/kind": "asset",
        "/0/target/id": "${assets.0.id}",
        "/1": null
      },
      "pending": "待协调：The region composer opens under the drawn region, but neither it nor a click into its text box takes the keyboard (found 2026-11-16 by sc-scenarios-v5: the bridge's typing reports no focused text field; the text box has no accessible node). Product issue in the viewer's region composer (dr-view-material page.rs compose / dr-view-review composer); drop this pending once typing reaches it."
    },
    {
      "app": "app.info",
      "save": "final_environment"
    }
  ]
}
